#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:7 dbbcb79a7f3f4a8e80baccb893fcfc61
msgid "ESC Signalling Issues"
msgstr "ESC 信号问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:9 ff62a6246e1c4b4796042cc186dcf056
msgid ""
"This page discusses several potential issues with ESC signaling that can "
"result in unreliable operation or even crashes on takeoff. These primarily "
"occur with larger QuadPlanes that have long runs to their ESCS from power "
"and the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"本页讨论 ESC 信号传输中几个可能导致操作不可靠甚至起飞时坠机的潜在问题。这些问题主要出现在大型 QuadPlane 上，因为其 ESC "
"与电源及飞控之间的走线较长。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:13 63766413ab4f4a2b921dfdfcf6bcf3d8
msgid "Inadequate Signaling Level"
msgstr "信号电平不足"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:15 3acaf339e09248adad3f7e0e6b4efd8d
msgid ""
"Most autopilots use TTL/CMOS compatible signaling on their outputs, but "
"usually only at 3.3V levels. This can ultimately result in poor signaling "
"waveforms or levels at the ESC, resulting in unreliable operation. "
"Contributing factors to that are:"
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控的输出端使用 TTL/CMOS 兼容信号，但通常仅为 3.3V 电平。这最终可能导致 ESC "
"端信号波形或电平较差，从而导致操作不可靠。影响因素包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:17 46677c3466154c60b5017d13bc3ca0c9
msgid "High impedance (either resistive or reactive) wiring runs"
msgstr "高阻抗（阻性或感性）走线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:18 94c5b82f315746f1a4a1a87c52030d18
msgid "ESC input loading is too heavy"
msgstr "ESC 输入负载过重"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:20 a1dcc7090ac34a5da66bf41575ed83d5
msgid ""
"For large, high-value vehicles, its always good to check the ESC signal "
"levels for each ESC with a scope to assure clean signaling. This is best "
"done with a ground runup to at least 70% throttle, either physically "
"securing the vehicle or mounting its props reversed temporarily."
msgstr ""
"对于大型、高价值的飞行器，建议用示波器检查每个 ESC 的信号电平，以确保信号清晰。最好在地面以至少 70% "
"油门进行测试，同时将飞行器固定或临时反向安装螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:22 d8a9b67141f242a5b1325ef58c02095c
msgid ""
"Below is an example scope trace for two ESC signals for ESCs presenting too "
"high an input load or too much wiring resistance. As shown, the second ESC's"
" analog level is about 3V, which is a little marginal, but the first ESC "
"trace is only about 2V and is too low for reliable operation."
msgstr ""
"以下是两个 ESC 信号的示波器波形示例，这两个 ESC 的输入负载过高或走线电阻过大。如图所示，第二个 ESC 的模拟电平约为 "
"3V，略显边缘，而第一个 ESC 的波形仅约 2V，对于可靠操作来说过低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:27 4dccbba571824abab790bb4353427f77
msgid ""
"It is also possible to see poor rise and fall times, but with adequate "
"voltage levels due to high reactance in the connection. This will also "
"affect timing and performance and should be corrected."
msgstr "由于连接线的高感抗，还可能出现上升沿和下降沿时间较慢但电压电平尚可的情况。这同样会影响时序和性能，需要加以纠正。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:30 dbeaecba0224408396371ef4e9eb1eca
msgid "Possible Solutions:"
msgstr "可能的解决方案："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:32 0e838c05d711402ea90c858c8882e2bc
msgid "lower wiring impedance with larger wiring or shorter runs"
msgstr "使用更粗的导线或缩短走线长度以降低走线阻抗"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:33 448ea9203fd94fc3af39afac784a922d
msgid "use ESCs that do not present such high input loading"
msgstr "使用输入负载不那么重的 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:34 072cca8389a948b5819249c5f59cd2cb
msgid ""
"add buffers to autopilot outputs to provide 5v signaling and higher drive "
"currents"
msgstr "在飞控输出端添加缓冲器，以提供 5V 信号和更高的驱动电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:35 44fd3ede2d924c4490a5d7299547de97
msgid ""
"some autopilots have the option of increasing their signal levels from 3.3V "
"to 5V using the :ref:`BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL<BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL>` = 1. See the "
"following list of autopilots that support this (if you can see this "
"parameter in your GCS parameter list, then your autopilot has this feature):"
msgstr ""
"某些飞控可通过设置 :ref:`BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL<BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL>` = 1 将信号电平从 3.3V 提高到 "
"5V。以下是支持此功能的飞控列表（如果您在地面站参数列表中能看到此参数，则您的飞控支持该功能）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:38 1df2787e054947ba9102411e8435d734
msgid "Autopilots with :ref:`BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL<BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL>`"
msgstr "支持 :ref:`BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL<BRD_PWM_VOLT_SEL>` 的飞控"

