#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:49 5db84ab0ef144c43a9217ef2677b7d27
msgid "Induced Noise"
msgstr "感应噪声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:51 a77f8d441f814d0887add23bd61d2ff9
msgid ""
"On large vehicles, the power or motor phase lines usually run in parallel "
"with the signal lines which provides an opportunity for high frequency noise"
" coupling. This can sometimes drastically impair the ESC operation as show "
"below in this video:"
msgstr "在大型飞行器上，电源线或电机相线通常与信号线平行走线，这为高频噪声耦合提供了条件。如下方视频所示，这有时会严重影响 ESC 的工作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:56 21be812cda1a40f3942544fa160297d8
msgid "Here are scope traces of the above situation:"
msgstr "以下是上述情况的示波器波形："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:61 163180a20a284d4399f1c037de579976
msgid ""
"As the current ramps, noise is being induced into the analog signal until it"
" finally is corrupt enough to be interpreted by the ESC as shutdown pulse "
"width, which it does, allowing the signaling to recover and repeat the "
"cycle."
msgstr "随着电流爬升，噪声被感应到模拟信号中，直至信号失真严重到被 ESC 解释为关机脉冲宽度，ESC 随即执行关机，使信号恢复并重复该循环。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:63 1dcf3852d4ec4bd0acf2475576d80b7e
msgid ""
"Expanding the section where the shutdown occurs, you can see that the analog"
" signal finally gets noisy enough for its digital logic level to be "
"incorrectly interpreted."
msgstr "将关机发生时的波形放大，可以看到模拟信号的噪声最终足以导致其数字逻辑电平被错误解释。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:69 5d750fb59eab4d6db1bc10ab8480017f
msgid "Solutions"
msgstr "解决方案"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:71 14dcbbd006134b6c815634bb99a39a99
msgid ""
"Physically separate the signal wiring from the power wiring to the ESCs"
msgstr "将信号走线与 ESC 的电源走线物理分离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:72 ea5dfc31196a4211880645a8227c97cc
msgid ""
"Place a small toroidal choke (designed for the 1-10MHz range) in each ESC "
"signal line"
msgstr "在每个 ESC 信号线上串联一个小型环形扼流圈（设计频率范围为 1-10MHz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:73 67f0e56bd322474a9542bab44dac2820
msgid "Add capacitor banks to power inputs of ESC. See next section."
msgstr "在 ESC 电源输入端增加电容组。参见下一节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:76 dced3fff76a7479698e75a558e2f76ef
msgid "ESC Overvoltage Spikes"
msgstr "ESC 过电压尖峰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:78 47b18b28e78d42148e1074a82973edf0
msgid ""
"Long power cabling runs from the battery to the ESC on larger vehicles can "
"produce large voltage spikes due to the lead inductance. These spikes not "
"only increase noise, increasing the potential for noise coupling to the "
"signal control lines of the ESC, but also can be potentially directly "
"damaging to the ESC. This can be reduced or eliminated by adding low ESR "
"capacitance at the ESC power inputs. An example of the typical capacitor "
"bank for these applications is offered by `Advanced Power Drives "
"<https://powerdrives.net/cap-bank>`__."
msgstr ""
"大型飞行器上从电池到 ESC 的长电源线缆会因导线电感产生较大的电压尖峰。这些尖峰不仅会增加噪声，提高噪声耦合到 ESC "
"控制信号线的可能性，还可能直接损坏 ESC。可通过在 ESC 电源输入端增加低 ESR 电容来减少或消除此问题。`Advanced Power "
"Drives <https://powerdrives.net/cap-bank>`__ 提供了适用于此类应用的典型电容组示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:81 ebc61fc8dd2c40a69d9f3ca74f0be76a
msgid "ESC Firmware Bugs"
msgstr "ESC 固件缺陷"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:83 234d29ea38d14d729af484064a426bed
msgid ""
"Some ESC firmware versions contain bugs which can seriously impact correct "
"operation with ArduPilot. The following lists some known bugs which users "
"should be aware of. Where workarounds are available they will be listed."
msgstr ""
"某些 ESC 固件版本存在缺陷，可能严重影响与 ArduPilot "
"的正常配合工作。以下列出了一些已知缺陷，用户应予以关注。如有可用的解决方案，将一并列出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:89 8219077aac7549309913fed7a57ff326
msgid "APD ESCs with anti-spark connectors"
msgstr "APD ESC 配合防火花接头"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:91 41fa8d51b18b40b88f1deef75cc17d00
msgid ""
"Vehicles running anti-spark connectors and APD ESCs with firmware versions "
"dated before November 2022 may be susceptible to an incorrect setting of the"
" over-voltage limit. If incorrectly set (when the pre-charge time constant "
"is over 200 ms), the ESC will prevent motor braking until it receives a zero"
" throttle command. The issue can cause the ESC to get into a state where "
"throttle can only increase, which will almost always result in a crash and "
"can be dangerous for people in the vicinity of the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"使用防火花接头并搭配 2022 年 11 月之前版本固件的 APD ESC "
"的飞行器，可能存在过电压限制设置不正确的问题。若设置不正确（当预充电时间常数超过 200ms 时），ESC "
"在收到零油门命令之前将阻止电机制动。该问题可导致 ESC 进入油门只能增加的状态，几乎必然导致坠机，并对飞行器周围的人员构成危险。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:98 6be83345d4f3492ab85551246f669318
msgid "The issue happens due to the following logic in the ESC firmware:"
msgstr "该问题由 ESC 固件中的以下逻辑引起："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:100
#: d5bd95d5d3584fed925057f47c8f0157
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"200 ms after ESC startup the supply voltage is sampled, where the maximum "
"voltage is taken as 120% of this point."
msgstr "ESC 启动后 200ms 时对供电电压进行采样，将该时刻电压的 120% 作为最大电压阈值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:101
#: 4373d003a1874a729339ca285e381422
msgid ""
"At any time after that, if the supply voltage is above this level, then an "
"over-voltage error is raised."
msgstr "此后任何时候，若供电电压超过该阈值，则触发过电压错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:102
#: bbb280057418489f894c2b84b52dd410
msgid ""
"While an over-voltage error is raised, the throttle will not be reduced "
"unless the autopilot demands a zero throttle."
msgstr "在过电压错误期间，除非飞控要求零油门，否则油门不会降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:104
#: db08d5876b454bf7ad743a849c43f4c7
msgid ""
"This feature aimed to prevent motor braking from pushing too much power back"
" into the batteries, which could lead to overcharging of the batteries or "
"excessive spikes on the ESC inputs."
msgstr "该功能旨在防止电机制动时向电池回馈过多能量，从而避免电池过充或 ESC 输入端出现过大尖峰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:107
#: c612d709df29457b88acd0e9de4220b6
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The issue happens if the rise time of the supply voltage is slow enough that"
" the voltage reaches less than 80% of the actual supply voltage within 200 "
"ms. This can happen when using anti-spark connectors to connect the "
"batteries, particularly with long wiring and significant levels of added "
"capacitance."
msgstr ""
"当供电电压上升速度较慢，导致 200ms 内电压未达到实际供电电压的 80% "
"时，就会触发该问题。在使用防火花接头连接电池时，尤其是在走线较长且附加电容量较大的情况下，可能发生这种情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:111
#: 5e8133ee97974f1199f21a153a8bd56a
msgid ""
"A firmware update, which resolves the above issue, is available and can be "
"found within the links below."
msgstr "已有修复上述问题的固件更新，可通过以下链接获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:113
#: 267b4eaef41f474e90f2d3317d2df68c
msgid ""
"`HV, HV Pro and UHV firmware "
"<https://docs.powerdrives.net/downloads/firmware-releases/uhv-and-hv-pro-"
"firmware#2.1.0-20th-december-2022-latest>`__."
msgstr ""
"`HV、HV Pro 和 UHV 固件 <https://docs.powerdrives.net/downloads/firmware-"
"releases/uhv-and-hv-pro-firmware#2.1.0-20th-december-2022-latest>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:115
#: 92fc110bbdba483d8abc130f91581aa4
msgid ""
"`F-Series firmware <https://docs.powerdrives.net/downloads/firmware-"
"releases/f-series-production-firmware>`__."
msgstr ""
"`F-Series 固件 <https://docs.powerdrives.net/downloads/firmware-"
"releases/f-series-production-firmware>`__。"
